Article 14.20: Unsolicited Commercial Electronic Messages1.Each Party shall adopt or maintain measures regarding unsolicited commercial electronic messages sent to an electronic address that:(a)require a supplier of unsolicited commercial electronic messages to facilitate the ability of recipients to prevent ongoing reception of those messages;
